This product can optionally download and run open-source models from ModelScope
(魔搭社区), including GLiNER (Apache-2.0), MemPrivacy (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0), and SiameseUIE
(Apache-2.0). The optional runtime and model weights are not distributed inside this
fnOS package and are fetched or imported on demand by the system administrator.

The Chinese entity scope, information extraction architecture, and local-review
product principles were informed by the public documentation of cn_pii_anonymization,
local-privacy-workbench, and PaddleNLP Taskflow UIE specifications.
This repository is an independent implementation and does not copy their code.
